 ations are impossible and no meeting point is identifiable? This is the ca
 se\, for example\, during a repressed social movement. In this talk\, Guil
 laume Moinard models protesters as random walks\, on a street network\, w
 \nLanguage: Not specified\nLanguage requirements: Not specified\nInterpret
