BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Why Model? Computational Approaches to Complex Socio-Ecological-Te
 chnological Systems
DTSTART:20261021T150000Z
DTEND:20261021T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T104118Z
UID:f494ce4c2992f62146b8949a@systemsmap.antlerboy.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Complexity
DESCRIPTION:Complexity Science Hub\nModeling in inherent in human percepti
 on of and communication about our world. And while powerful\, our innate m
 odeling abilities are often insufficient to understand and manage the comp
 lex world in which we live. Human socio-ecological-technological systems (
