BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Causality at Machine Learning Scale and Complexity
DTSTART:20261104T150000Z
DTEND:20261104T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261024T085707Z
UID:8152cef96c1c683deb0369fd@systemsmap.antlerboy.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Complexity
DESCRIPTION:Complexity Science Hub\nDistinguishing coincidence from cause-
 and-effect relationships is a central challenge in AI (and science): which
  patterns just co-occur\, and which signal causality? Statistical causalit
 y offers a rigorous framework for this question\, but it assumes clean\, l
 ow-dimensional\, structured data\, which clashes with the raw\, high-dimen
