BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WEdnesday SALON – When to Trust AI and When to Think for Ourselv
 es
DTSTART:20261123T180000Z
DTEND:20261123T192000Z
DTSTAMP:20261021T092622Z
UID:c58d30077f596439a12f9271@systemsmap.antlerboy.com
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Complexity
DESCRIPTION:Complexity Science Hub\nStaying smart in a smart world. From d
 ating apps to self-driving cars\, AI promises to make life easier and deci
 sions better. But what can algorithms really do – and when should we tru
 st our own judgment? Join Gerd Gigerenzer (exceptionally not on a WEdnesda
